{"content":[{"c":["ELON (P",{"c":["lace"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Village near Timnah, the home of Samson’s first wife. Elon was included in the inheritance allotted to Dan’s tribe in Joshua’s distribution of the Promised Land (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.19.43","r":"Josh.19.43","rawR":"Josh.19.43","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.19.43","value":"Josh.19.43"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 19:43"},"; cf. ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.14.1-2","r":"Josh.14.1-2","rawR":"Josh.14.1-2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.14.1-2","value":"Josh.14.1-2"}],"t":"ref","v":"14:1-2"},"). It is generally identified with Khirbet Wadi ’Alinm near ’Ain Shems."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"ElonPlace","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 19:43","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.19.43","rawQueryValue":"Josh.19.43","sourceRefExact":"Josh.19.43"},{"anchorText":"14:1-2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.14.1-2","rawQueryValue":"Josh.14.1-2","sourceRefExact":"Josh.14.1-2"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"016da4df92c7a54baebca1d7bb8e867d6d3b17a1c30e5b16b6e17b814b6ec8b0","sourceItemName":"ElonPlace","sourceItemOrder":135,"sourceMember":"Articles/E.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"ElonPlace","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Elon (Place)","title":"Elon (Place)","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}